    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Get Involved</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">There are more ways to be part of this than just playing</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about-body">
      <p>If you are a player, find a sanctioned event near you on the <a href="/events/">Events calendar</a> and show up. All you need is a legal roster and a Longshanks account.</p>

      <p>If you want to contribute to the circuit beyond playing, we are always looking for support in a few key areas:</p>
    </div>

    <div class="contribute-grid">
      <div class="contribute-card">
        <div class="contribute-title">Prize Support</div>
        <p>Helping furnish prizes for Qualifier winners and Championship participants makes the circuit more rewarding for everyone. We always welcome prize support via promos, custom cards, 3D printed products, store credit, or any prizes! Please reach out.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="contribute-card">
        <div class="contribute-title">Hosting Events</div>
        <p>If you run a store and want to bring a Shards Event to your community, check out the <a href="/apply/">event application</a>. Hosting a Shards Event is also the path to being considered for an Infinity Qualifier designation in future seasons.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="contribute-card">
        <div class="contribute-title">Spreading the Word</div>
        <p>Share events with your local play groups, post about the circuit on social media, or help us reach stores and players we have not connected with yet. Growing the regional community benefits everyone.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="contribute-card">
        <div class="contribute-title">Organization and Logistics</div>
        <p>As the circuit grows, there is more work to go around. If you have skills in event coordination, content creation/streaming, or community management and want to get involved behind the scenes, we want to hear from you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-body" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
      <p>The best place to start any of these conversations is the <strong>Carolina Protocol Discord</strong>, the regional Marvel: Crisis Protocol community and the official home of the Infinity Circuit. <a href="https://discord.gg/GPVX3B6C84" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join the Carolina Protocol Discord</a>.</p>
      <p>The Infinity Circuit is not affiliated with Atomic Mass Games or Marvel. All Marvel: Crisis Protocol rules and content are property of their respective owners.</p>
    </div>

